    narr:generatedFrom "d451297a6dd1dbdf2eecccafc5b2a8b4c1a89a3a" ;
    narr:narration """Tanya's voice here is a chair converting deliberation into settled rules, now across five dated conversations. In the first she [bounds the meeting against a steering-group deadline](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_1), [states her landing position before hearing others](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_8), [prices the cutovers as contained versus unbounded risk](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_13), probes rather than accepts ([asking where a two-week figure comes from](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_18)), then [ratifies the reasoning on the record](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_20), [orders the reporting constraint written as a rule, not guidance](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_31), adds [a political framing that keeps reference-data blame on the vendor](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_39), and [rehearses her steering-group script](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_42). A week later she [briefs a newcomer on the settled shape](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_2), [restates the one-at-a-time rule](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_7), and — the notable move — [adopts someone else's sharper version of her own argument](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_13), [committing to lead with it](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_17). The same day she [clarifies what is and isn't changing](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_10), [redirects recovered time into a buffer](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_18), [formally supersedes her own earlier note on the record](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_20), [credits the better argument she'd been given that morning](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_12), and [thanks the person for raising it rather than letting it ride](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_23). A third meeting that day opens a fresh front: [a legal question nobody in the programme can answer](narr:Expr_5HalyardLegacyArchive20260922_1) about [what happens to eleven years of closed history left on the old platform](narr:Expr_5HalyardLegacyArchive20260922_3); she [adds her own reason for an obviously-closed archive](narr:Expr_5HalyardLegacyArchive20260922_16), [insists the retention number come from legal in writing](narr:Expr_5HalyardLegacyArchive20260922_20), [states the full position formally](narr:Expr_5HalyardLegacyArchive20260922_22), and [admits she'd have got the sequencing wrong on her own](narr:Expr_5HalyardLegacyArchive20260922_25). The newest thread is a first: [an outside advisor brought in for a pre-board read](narr:Expr_6HalyardAdvisorTonyMaley20260929_1), where she [summarises the settled plan in one breath](narr:Expr_6HalyardAdvisorTonyMaley20260929_3), [concedes a critique nobody had raised before](narr:Expr_6HalyardAdvisorTonyMaley20260929_20), and [commits to presenting the gap to the board proactively](narr:Expr_6HalyardAdvisorTonyMaley20260929_28). The register stays casual-but-commanding, antithesis and parallelism dominant in her org lane, with consultation and legitimate authority run side by side.""" ;
